    "text": "abcnews4.com\nwebsite\nSt George\nLowcountry woman wins $200,000 on $5 Jurassic Park scratch-off ticket\nBy Abigail Quinn,\n12 hours agoSAINT GEORGE, S.C. (WCIV) — One Lowcountry woman won big with a Saint George scratch off ticket, taking home a $200,000 prize from a $5 ticket. The winning woman says that the Jurassic Park themed ticket was not chosen out of nostalgia but rather the affordability of the ticket.\n44",
